#. Summary:	Help texts of all the dialogs
#. Authors:	Michal Zugec <mzugec@suse.cz>
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:36
msgid ""
"If authentication is needed for secure access, please use <b>Authentication "
"by Initiator</b> and <b>Authentication by Targets</b> together. Please do "
"not only use one of them for security reasons.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກຕ້ອງການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນເພື່ອການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ປອດໄພ, ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ <b>ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໂດຍ "
"Initiator</b> ແລະ <b>ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໂດຍ Targets</b> ຄວບຄູ່ກັນ. ກະລຸນາຢ່າໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຢ່າງໃດຢ່າ"
"ງໜຶ່ງເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ.\n"

#. the help text for the startup modes, architecture dependent
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:41
msgid ""
"<p><b>manual</b> is for iSCSI targets which are not to be connected by\n"
"default, the user needs to connect them manually</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>manual (ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ)</b> ແມ່ນສຳລັບ iSCSI targets ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້"
"ນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ</p>\n"

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:43
msgid ""
"<p><b>onboot</b> is for iSCSI targets to be connected during boot, i.e. "
"when\n"
"root is on iSCSI. As such it will be evaluated by the initrd.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>onboot (ເມື່ອເລີ່ມລະບົບ)</b> ແມ່ນສຳລັບ iSCSI targets ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການບູດເຄື່"
"ອງ, ເຊັ່ນ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ root ຢູ່ເທິງ iSCSI. ເຊິ່ງມັນຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໂດຍ initrd.</p>\n"

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:45
msgid ""
"<p><b>automatic</b> is for iSCSI targets to be connected when the iSCSI "
"service\n"
"starts up.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>automatic (ອັດຕະໂນມັດ)</b> ແມ່ນສຳລັບ iSCSI targets ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເມື່ອບໍລິການ "
"iSCSI ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ.</p>\n"

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:47
msgid ""
"<p>When iBFT (iSCSI Boot Firmware Table) is used, the startup mode of the\n"
"node is irrelevant. For that reason, the widget is disabled if iBFT is\n"
"detected by YaST.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເມື່ອມີການນຳໃຊ້ iBFT (iSCSI Boot Firmware Table), ໂໝດການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ node ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ. "
"ດ້ວຍເຫດນັ້ນ, ວິດເຈັດນີ້ຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ຖ້າ YaST ກວດພົບ iBFT.</p>\n"

#. Read dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:56
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Initializing iSCSI Initiator Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Please wait...<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການກຳນົດຄ່າ iSCSI Initiator</big></b><br>\n"
"ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...<br></p>\n"

#. Read dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:60
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Initialization</big></b><br>\n"
"Safely abort the configuration utility by pressing <b>Abort</b> now.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງຍົກເລີກການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</big></b><br>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກເຄື່ອງມືການກຳນົດຄ່າຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍການກົດ <b>ຍົກເລີກ (Abort)</b> ດຽວນີ້.</p>\n"

#. Write dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:64
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Saving iSCSI Initiator Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Please wait...<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງບັນທຶກການກຳນົດຄ່າ iSCSI Initiator</big></b><br>\n"
"ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...<br></p>\n"

#. Write dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:68
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Saving</big></b><br>\n"
"Abort the save procedure by pressing <b>Abort</b>.\n"
"An additional dialog informs whether it is safe to do so.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງຍົກເລີກການບັນທຶກ</big></b><br>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກຂັ້ນຕອນການບັນທຶກໂດຍການກົດ <b>ຍົກເລີກ (Abort)</b>.\n"
"ຈະມີກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນວ່າການຍົກເລີກນັ້ນປອດໄພຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:75
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>iSCSI Initiator Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Configure an iSCSI initiator here.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການກຳນົດຄ່າ iSCSI Initiator</big></b><br>\n"
"ກຳນົດຄ່າ iSCSI initiator ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້.<br></p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:79
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Adding an iSCSI Initiator</big></b><br>\n"
"Select an iSCSI initiator from the list of detected initiators.\n"
"If your iSCSI initiator was not detected, use <b>Other (not detected)</b>.\n"
"Then press <b>Configure</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການເພີ່ມ iSCSI Initiator</big></b><br>\n"
"ເລືອກ iSCSI initiator ຈາກລາຍຊື່ທີ່ກວດພົບ.\n"
"ຖ້າ iSCSI initiator ຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ຖືກກວດພົບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ <b>ອື່ນໆ (ກວດບໍ່ພົບ)</b>.\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນກົດ <b>ກຳນົດຄ່າ (Configure)</b>.</p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:86
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting</big></b><br>\n"
"If you press <b>Edit</b>, an additional dialog in which to change\n"
"the configuration opens.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ການລຶບ</big></b><br>\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານກົດ <b>ແກ້ໄຂ (Edit)</b>, ຈະມີກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປີດຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງການກຳນົດຄ່າ.</p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:92
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>iSCSI Initiator Configuration Overview</big></b><br>\n"
"Obtain an overview of installed iSCSI initiators. Additionally\n"
"edit their configurations.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ພາບລວມການກຳນົດຄ່າ iSCSI Initiator</big></b><br>\n"
"ເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງ iSCSI initiators ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ ແລະ ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂການກຳນົດຄ່າໄດ້.<br></p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:98
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Adding an iSCSI Initiator</big></b><br>\n"
"Press <b>Add</b> to configure an iSCSI initiator.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການເພີ່ມ iSCSI Initiator</big></b><br>\n"
"ກົດ <b>ເພີ່ມ (Add)</b> ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ iSCSI initiator.</p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:102
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting</big></b><br>\n"
"Choose an iSCSI Initiator to change or remove.\n"
"Then press <b>Edit</b> or <b>Delete</b> as desired.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ການລຶບ</big></b><br>\n"
"ເລືອກ iSCSI Initiator ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບອອກ.\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນກົດ <b>ແກ້ໄຂ (Edit)</b> ຫຼື <b>ລຶບ (Delete)</b> ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.</p>\n"

#. table of connected targets
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:108
msgid ""
"<p>List of current sessions.</p><p>Use the <b>Add</b> button to get "
"additional targets. A discovery is started to detect new targets and the "
"start-up mode of already connected targets keeps unchanged.<br>Use "
"<b>Disconnect</b> to cancel the connection and with it remove the target "
"from the list.<br>To change the start-up status, press <b>Edit</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ລາຍຊື່ຂອງ session ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.</p><p>ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ <b>ເພີ່ມ (Add)</b> ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ targets ອື່ນໆ. ກ"
"ານຄົ້ນຫາຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຫາ targets ໃໝ່ ແລະ ໂໝດການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ targets ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວຈະຄືເກົ່າ.<br>"
"ໃຊ້ <b>ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Disconnect)</b> ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ລຶບ target ອອກຈາກລາຍ"
"ຊື່.<br>ຫາກຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນສະຖານະການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກົດ <b>ແກ້ໄຂ (Edit)</b>.</p>"

#. Warning
#. Warning
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:117 src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:138
msgid "<h1>Warning</h1>"
msgstr "<h1>ຄຳເຕືອນ</h1>"

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:118 src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:139
msgid ""
"<p>When accessing an iSCSI device <b>READ</b>/<b>WRITE</b>, make sure that "
"this access is exclusive. Otherwise there is a potential risk of data "
"corruption.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເມື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງອຸປະກອນ iSCSI ແບບ <b>ອ່ານ (READ)</b>/<b>ຂຽນ (WRITE)</b>, ກະລຸນາກວດສອ"
"ບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງນີ້ເປັນແບບຜູກຂາດ (exclusive). ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ອາດມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຈະເສຍຫາຍໄ"
"ດ້.</p>\n"

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:121
msgid ""
"<p><b>Initiator Name</b> is a value from <tt>/etc/iscsi/initiatorname.iscsi</"
"tt>. \n"
"In case you have iBFT, this value will be added from there and you are only "
"able to change it in the BIOS setup.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຊື່ Initiator</b> ແມ່ນຄ່າຈາກ <tt>/etc/iscsi/initiatorname.iscsi</tt>. \n"
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານມີ iBFT, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມມາຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນ ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງມັນໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ BIOS ເ"
"ທົ່ານັ້ນ.</p>"

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:124
msgid ""
"<p><b>iSCSI Iface</b> allows to select an specific iSCSI iface to be used "
"for discovering targets.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>iSCSI Iface</b> ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກອິນເຕີເຟສ iSCSI ສະເພາະເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຄົ້ນຫາ "
"targets.</p>"

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:127
msgid ""
"If you want to use <b>iSNS</b> (Internet  Storage  Name Service) for "
"discovering targets instead of the default SendTargets method,\n"
"fill in the IP address of the iSNS server and port. The default port should "
"be 3205.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ <b>iSNS</b> (Internet Storage Name Service) ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ targets ແທນ"
"ວິທີ SendTargets ມາດຕະຖານ,\n"
"ໃຫ້ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຊີບເວີ iSNS ແລະ ພອດ. ພອດມາດຕະຖານຄວນແມ່ນ 3205.\n"

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:132
msgid ""
"Enter the <b>IP Address</b> of the iSCSI target server.\n"
"Only change <b>Port</b>. If you do not need authentication,\n"
"select <b>No Discovery Authentication</b>. "
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນ <b>ທີ່ຢູ່ IP</b> ຂອງເຊີບເວີ iSCSI target.\n"
"ປ່ຽນສະເພາະ <b>ພອດ</b>. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ,\n"
"ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <b>ບໍ່ມີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃນການຄົ້ນຫາ (No Discovery Authentication)</b>. "

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:146
msgid ""
"List of nodes offered by the iSCSI target. Select one item and click "
"<b>Connect</b>.  "
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ຂອງ nodes ທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ iSCSI target. ເລືອກລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວກົດ <b>ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ "
"(Connect)</b>.  "

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:153
msgid "<h1>Startup</h1>"
msgstr "<h1>ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</h1>"

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:155
msgid "<h1>Authentication</h1>"
msgstr "<h1>ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ</h1>"

#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:156
msgid ""
"<p>The default setting here is <i>No Authentication</i>. Uncheck the "
"checkbox if authentication is needed for security reasons."
msgstr ""
"<p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ແມ່ນ <i>ບໍ່ມີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (No Authentication)</i>. ໃຫ້ເອົາເຄື່ອງໝາຍອອກຖ້"
"າຫາກຕ້ອງການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ."

#. list of discovered targets
#: src/include/iscsi-client/helps.rb:161
msgid ""
"<p>This screen shows the list of discovered targets.</p><p>Use the "
"<b>Discovery</b> button to get available iSCSI targets from a server "
"specified by IP address.<br><b>Connect</b> to a target to establih the "
"connection. If login was successful the column <i>Connected</i> shows status "
"'True' and the target will appear on the <i>Connected Targets</i> screen."
"<br>To remove a target use the <b>Delete</b> button.<br> <b>Hint:</b> "
"Removing of targets is only possible for not connected onces. If required, "
"<b>Disconnect</b> at <i>Connected Targets</i> first.</p><p><b>Please note:</"
"b> Starting the <b>Discovery</b> again means doing a re-discovery of targets "
"which possibly will change the start-up mode of already connected targets "
"(to default 'manual'). Switch to <i>Connected Targets</i> screen and use the "
"<b>Add</b> button if you want to add new targets without changing the start-"
"up mode.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໜ້ານີ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຂອງ targets ທີ່ຄົ້ນພົບ.</p><p>ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ <b>ຄົ້ນຫາ (Discovery)</b> ເພື່ອເບິ່ງ "
"iSCSI targets ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການຈາກເຊີບເວີຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ກຳນົດ.<br><b>ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Connect)</b> ໄປຫ"
"າ target ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ຖ້າການເຂົ້າລະບົບສຳເລັດ ຖັນ <i>ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ (Connected)</i> ຈະສ"
"ະແດງສະຖານະເປັນ 'True' ແລະ target ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນໜ້າ <i>Targets ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ</i>.<br>ຫາກ"
"ຕ້ອງການລຶບ target ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ <b>ລຶບ (Delete)</b>.<br> <b>ຂໍ້ແນະນຳ:</b> ການລຶບ target ແມ່"
"ນເຮັດໄດ້ສະເພາະອັນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ <b>ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Disconnect)</b> ໃນໜ້"
"າ <i>Targets ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ</i> ກ່ອນ.</p><p><b>ກະລຸນາໝາຍເຫດ:</b> ການເລີ່ມ <b>ຄົ້ນຫາ "
"(Discovery)</b> ໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງໝາຍເຖິງການຄົ້ນຫາ targets ຄືນໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະປ່ຽນໂໝດການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ "
"targets ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ (ໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນ 'manual' ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ). ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ໜ້າ <i>Targets ທີ່ເຊື່ອມ"
"ຕໍ່ແລ້ວ</i> ແລະ ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ <b>ເພີ່ມ (Add)</b> ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ targets ໃໝ່ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໂໝດການເລີ່"
"ມຕົ້ນ.</p>"

